Rem A disk AMOS asks for is dropped and the requester goes on; a floppy swapped, taken out (host only, AMOS_DROP)
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Print #1,"asked";Drive("Disk2:")
Open In 2,"Disk2:b.txt" : Line Input #2,B$ : Close 2 : Print #1,"read ";B$
Print #1,"mounted";Drive("Disk2:");Drive("dh1:");Exist("dh1:b.txt")
Wait 150
Print #1,"df0 ";Exist("df0:c.txt");Exist("Disk3:c.txt")
Wait 150
Print #1,"empty";Exist("df0:c.txt");Drive("df0:");Drive("Disk3:")
Trap Open In 2,"df0:c.txt" : Print #1,"no disk";Errtrap
Print #1,"end"
